// Ported ARK cloud-pull transfer macro, run under the dryrun host. Proves a
// real multi-step Marco macro compiles and executes end-to-end over the host
// FFI, including a `use os.` import of the act surface.

use os.

the Ark is an actor.

this can Transfer.
this's Transfer does...
    the argent is a Point with X 1258, Y 550.
    the cloudPull is a Point with X 1493, Y 28.
    the search is a Point with X 1400, Y 80.
    the slot1 is a Point with X 1400, Y 200.
    the transferAll is a Point with X 1500, Y 600.
    the close is a Point with X 1900, Y 28.

    do OS's Click with argent.
    do OS's Sleep with 250.
    do OS's Click with cloudPull.
    do OS's Sleep with 250.
    do OS's Click with search.
    do OS's Sleep with 150.
    do OS's Type with "stone".
    do OS's Sleep with 150.
    do OS's Click with slot1.
    do OS's Sleep with 500.
    do OS's Click with transferAll.
    do OS's Sleep with 500.
    do OS's Click with close.
    this is ok!

the App is a script.

do Ark's Transfer...
    when ok?
        log "transferred stone from argent".
    or?
        log that's error.
